TTT has no Just grammar in its 125 compiled grammars, so the editor cannot
highlight a justfile or send it to just-lsp without this file. We declare it
through "editor.grammars" in ttt-settings.json. We do not install the lang-just
plugin, because that would need the plugin system, an approval dialog and a
git clone at first run.

